  "identifier": "highdicom",
  "name": "highdicom",
  "description": "High-level Python library built on pydicom for creating and reading derived DICOM objects — segmentations (SEG), parametric maps, structured reports (SR), comprehensive 3D SR, and annotation objects. Enables computational pathology and radiology pipelines to store analysis results in standards-compliant DICOM rather than proprietary formats, ensuring interoperability with PACS and clinical systems. Maintained by NCI Imaging Data Commons with support from the Alliance for Digital Pathology, QIICR, and MGB AI.",
  "url": "https://highdicom.readthedocs.io",
